{"title":"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Alternative_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternative Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mary is about to pay for five items at the grocery store.  The prices of the items are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2eceed782a69fb4ec1ccc1fe1219381e87f24016.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$7.99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/d/63d3094ac9bbabfd6b519d47eb1f5b3cbdea97a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$4.99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/7/327719b60bcf77f6b9dd07334afe52d222609079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2.99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/7/137aefc7346e9338d372a42246b9a36a2391a408.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$1.99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/c/1ec8a10ce3bac2b35204c0c0ee2315192ee1fcb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$0.99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />.  Mary will pay with a twenty-dollar bill.  Which of the following is closest to the percentage of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/8/ee8b158a4831195dbf4827a2edf8b53e5fbfec95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> that she will receive in change?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71b093adc3a4f4fb890240978eba5db1bd5910f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text {(A) } 5 \\qquad \\text {(B) } 10 \\qquad \\text {(C) } 15 \\qquad \\text {(D) } 20 \\qquad \\text {(E) } 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The total price of the items is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/9/049b385136cfb85e7e91e37d83e762090bff151a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8-.01)+(5-.01)+(3-.01)+(2-.01)+(1-.01)=19-.05=18.95$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"585\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f7ec93d66f4ba53a8457499c6ac50280b98ac5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20-18.95=1.05$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"140\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74a71e5c26a9306bf0acfa33e045a63101bf7c54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1.05}{20}=.0525 \\Rightarrow \\text{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"154\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternative_Solution\">Alternative Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Alternative Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can round the prices to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/f/18fd49bfe9eedbf7ce8769bfa332aed62ded072e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 - (8+5+3+2+1) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"221\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We can make an equation: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a7074f5cda9169e4599a24134cb1532f964d4f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20* \\frac{x}{100}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p>If we simplify the equation to \"x\", we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/c/51c80ea5862b45877f08d698a0c893bd2806a2fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B\">2006 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wi